{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錫明居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錫明居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍舒居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如清閑勵志者，每日早晚盥手焚香，先誦《阿彌陀經》一卷、徃生呪三\n遍。○焚香之火，切戒向竈內取。○再能加誦《金剛經》、《大懺悔文》及一切大乘經典更好。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或五百聲千聲以至萬聲，愈多愈好。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "各十聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈雲懺主作，或念蓮池大師西方發願文亦可。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世事煩雜，不能如前奉持，可行此法。久久專切，亦得徃生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0412001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0412001", "type": "orig", "text": "目錄新作"}
